        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "However, it also requires transferring the KV cache from the prefill instance to the decode instance before token generation can begin, making efficient KV transfer critical to time-to-first-token (TTFT).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/push-based-kv-transfer-to-improve-ttft-and-tpot-for-disaggregated-inference-in-vllm/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
