        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:36.040Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "One of the ways vLLM performs this transfer is through the NVIDIA Inference Xfer Library (NIXL) connector , which moves KV blocks over interconnects that support Remote Direct Memory Access (RDMA), such as AWS Elastic Fabric Adapter ( AWS EFA , the low-latency RDMA network use…",
